WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.405
Dad: Aren't you playing baseball with Brian?

2
00:00:16.406 --> 00:00:19.947
Ricky: He has a dentist appointment.

3
00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:24.075
Dad: I can't work and you can't play games.

4
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:28.077
Ricky: Don't remind me.

5
00:00:28.078 --> 00:00:31.351
Dad: We should do something else.

6
00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:35.542
Ricky: Like what?

7
00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:38.908
Dad: We can build our own city.

8
00:00:38.909 --> 00:00:46.340
Ricky: Our own city? How?

9
00:00:46.341 --> 00:00:49.839
Dad: Use your imagination, Ricky.

10
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:58.170
Ricky: Hmmm, what can I make with this?

11
00:00:58.171 --> 00:01:03.750
Ricky: Look, Dad! I'm making a car!

12
00:01:03.751 --> 00:01:07.226
Rachel: What are you doing?

13
00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:09.733
Ricky: We're building a city.

14
00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:14.640
Rachel: Can I make some houses?

15
00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:17.749
Mom: What is everyone doing?

16
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:25.108
Ricky: We're having fun.

